      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive guidance and gentle grooming"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently commend the grooming personnel for assisting newcomers at the self-wash stations and patiently handling nail grinding. Several clients mention specific groomers who put nervous or arthritic dogs at ease, although one visitor noted uneven handling when their regular groomer was away. Overall reception of team support remains predominantly encouraging."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comfortable atmosphere for visiting dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners highlight how comfortably their pets are treated during wash sessions and haircuts. Many reviewers note that shy or reactive dogs settle down nicely thanks to steady care, and pets return home energetic rather than stressed. The presence of calm handling during nail trims receives repeated praise across recent visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean facility and self-wash stations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the clean premises, spacious parking lot, and well-maintained self-wash tubs equipped with dryers and specialty shampoos. Reviewers also value the television monitors in the lobby that allow pet owners to observe their dogs inside the grooming rooms throughout the styling process."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
