      "q": {
        "en": "What equipment is provided in the self-wash area?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The facility supplies elevated wash tubs, blow dryers, specialty grooming tools, and shampoos so owners can wash pets comfortably without bending down."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pet parents watch their dogs while being groomed?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the waiting lobby features television monitors broadcasting live video from inside each individual grooming room for owner peace of mind."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the boutique offer wash membership packages?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Multiple reviewers report purchasing monthly self-wash memberships for frequent visits, though self-service wash stations close earlier than retail hours."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
